	)
	(text "Notes:\n1) Reverse-engineered from the physical board.  Not a manufacturer drawing.\n   Signal names from the DSI manual are used where they exist; all others, and \n   all symbol references, are the author's.  Symbol reference physical locations \n   documented separately.\n2) Serial version represented here, parallel hardware unused. Including:\n   J1, F1/F2, unpopulated DIP-14 near U2, R3, R6, PUNCH_SPROCKET_EN(J2-12)\n3) Serial board grounds J2-14 (~{SERIAL_DETECT}), which selects the serial\n   punch strobe.  Board always runs in buffered (FIFO) mode.\n4) GND & GND_24V are separate on this board.  They only tie together in the PSU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 179.324 171.196 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
